  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the Palliative Care Program pain relief medication, a special diet and equipment loan are guaranteed not only to the child, but also to the family, in order to give the patient, the possibility to stay comfortable in the household. In this delicate stage, psychological accompaniment it is also provided to the whole family. The Palliative Care Model is being replicated in 4 Latin American countries.</narrative>
